(6553464, 975674, 54645, '<td valign="top">Coming from a man standing at the bedside everyday, this image is stunning. Penny''s love is palpable, as is her apparent complete relief, knowing all will be well. It is a genuine expression that always brings me joy, and brings me back to the hospital when things don''t go well, and all I see is desperation, fear, and uncertainty. I love moments like this in the hospital. They are easy to forget, while the ghosts never leave. Can''t vote, so I thank you for the pure emotion with a simple thumb. Carry on friend.<br/> <br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=963227" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/54645/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_963227.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/54645/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_963227.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/54645/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_963227.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Coming from a man standing at the bedside everyday, this image is stunning. Penny''s love is palpable, as is her apparent complete relief, knowing all will be well. It is a genuine expression that always brings me joy, and brings me back to the hospital when things don''t go well, and all I see is desperation, fear, and uncertainty. I love moments like this in the hospital. They are easy to forget, while the ghosts never leave. Can''t vote, so I thank you for the pure emotion with a simple thumb. Carry on friend.  ', '2011-09-28 02:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
