(6553681, 975970, 53147, '<td valign="top">HAH! Someone mistook me for you. Which is funny because there is no way of denying this is you and not me and the pic of me is not you but me. I wouldn''t have thought you was me because this is obviously you and not me. Nor would I thought me was you because I am most certainly me and not you. But then I guess I knew I was me and not you in the first place so that gave me a slight advantage on the whole situation. My guess is that you wouldn''t think I was you either. All that said - I gave you a 7 even knowing it is you (and not me). But we are still going to whomp your this week. Village Burners are going down! ;)</td>', 'HAH! Someone mistook me for you. Which is funny because there is no way of denying this is you and not me and the pic of me is not you but me. I wouldn''t have thought you was me because this is obviously you and not me. Nor would I thought me was you because I am most certainly me and not you. But then I guess I knew I was me and not you in the first place so that gave me a slight advantage on the whole situation. My guess is that you wouldn''t think I was you either. All that said - I gave you a 7 even knowing it is you (and not me). But we are still going to whomp your this week. Village Burners are going down! ;)', '2011-09-28 07:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
