(6553779, 974924, 117474, '<td valign="top">Irish wolfhound! Love them dogs. When I was 8 I had a paper round where I cycled to my neighbourhood dropping newspapers around the place. Once, an Irish wolfhound got overly excited on seeing me and ran to me and I fell off my bike. He then came over and stared licking my face, but I was terrified he was going to eat me! <br/>They''re also pretty dumb, but really friendly. They used be vicious and be much much larger and stronger. Great dogs though!</td>', 'Irish wolfhound! Love them dogs. When I was 8 I had a paper round where I cycled to my neighbourhood dropping newspapers around the place. Once, an Irish wolfhound got overly excited on seeing me and ran to me and I fell off my bike. He then came over and stared licking my face, but I was terrified he was going to eat me! They''re also pretty dumb, but really friendly. They used be vicious and be much much larger and stronger. Great dogs though!', '2011-09-28 09:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
