(6555656, 975842, 53147, '<td valign="top">Struggling to figure out what the blob in the lower right is. Hoping you have that in your details.</td>', 'Struggling to figure out what the blob in the lower right is. Hoping you have that in your details.', '2011-09-30 07:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6555661, 975823, 53147, '<td valign="top">Hey Neil. This feels like a rushed image. Technically your lighting isnt balanced well between the foreground and background and seems to be hitting low on the front side (yet with a strong shadow on her neck). The forced kiss is quirky but I wonder if there was something you could do to play that up even more. As is it just feels like an idea incomplete.</td>', 'Hey Neil. This feels like a rushed image. Technically your lighting isnt balanced well between the foreground and background and seems to be hitting low on the front side (yet with a strong shadow on her neck). The forced kiss is quirky but I wonder if there was something you could do to play that up even more. As is it just feels like an idea incomplete.', '2011-09-30 07:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6555665, 975869, 53147, '<td valign="top">Uhhmm... Interesting editing/lighting choices. Not in a good way though.</td>', 'Uhhmm... Interesting editing/lighting choices. Not in a good way though.', '2011-09-30 07:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6555670, 975765, 53147, '<td valign="top">My eye wishes that at least one of the faces was completely in focus. The shallow DoF is just not working for me and your left eye so out of focus is actually making me blink because i think i have something in my eye causing it. Just feels wierd. A little clone work on the left side would be nice to to clean up the edge there.</td>', 'My eye wishes that at least one of the faces was completely in focus. The shallow DoF is just not working for me and your left eye so out of focus is actually making me blink because i think i have something in my eye causing it. Just feels wierd. A little clone work on the left side would be nice to to clean up the edge there.', '2011-09-30 07:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6555671, 975662, 53147, '<td valign="top">Technically not a strong image. Cropped body parts, a bit grainy and your boy facing into the shadows. That all said. I am really enjoying this image. You can see the love. An image to cherish. All of that blows away the technical issues. 7</td>', 'Technically not a strong image. Cropped body parts, a bit grainy and your boy facing into the shadows. That all said. I am really enjoying this image. You can see the love. An image to cherish. All of that blows away the technical issues. 7', '2011-09-30 07:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6555672, 975942, 53147, '<td valign="top">This one is a little noisy compared to Karen''s - but I much prefer the warmness of light and color of yours, Sharon.  ;)</td>', 'This one is a little noisy compared to Karen''s - but I much prefer the warmness of light and color of yours, Sharon.  ;)', '2011-09-30 07:39:27.000000', NULL, 1);
