(6557335, 974924, 109227, '<td valign="top">Beautiful classic portrait; beautiful dog and lady. (voted earlier)</td>', 'Beautiful classic portrait; beautiful dog and lady. (voted earlier)', '2011-10-01 17:58:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6557336, 975454, 109227, '<td valign="top">What a handsome duo; the image shows the affection. (voted earlier)</td>', 'What a handsome duo; the image shows the affection. (voted earlier)', '2011-10-01 17:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6557392, 975787, 65234, '<td valign="top">Certainly not a stereotypical portrait pose!  And not one I could even begin to achieve LOL.  More like a portrait of the cat and you''re the furniture, but since that may well say something about your relationship I''m going with it ;-)</td>', 'Certainly not a stereotypical portrait pose!  And not one I could even begin to achieve LOL.  More like a portrait of the cat and you''re the furniture, but since that may well say something about your relationship I''m going with it ;-)', '2011-10-01 19:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6557393, 975873, 65234, '<td valign="top">Well done.</td>', 'Well done.', '2011-10-01 19:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6557394, 975871, 65234, '<td valign="top">Grandma is VERY brave!</td>', 'Grandma is VERY brave!', '2011-10-01 19:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6557396, 975909, 65234, '<td valign="top">She knows which ones you like best ;-)</td>', 'She knows which ones you like best ;-)', '2011-10-01 19:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6557406, 975674, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very poignant.  Between the oxygen tube and the cellphone camera look and what appears to be a tray table reflected in Robert''s eye, this clearly tells a story of partners weathering an episode of illness.  Can''t really tell Robert''s attitude because of that reflection, but Penny looks pretty optimistic.</td>', 'Very poignant.  Between the oxygen tube and the cellphone camera look and what appears to be a tray table reflected in Robert''s eye, this clearly tells a story of partners weathering an episode of illness.  Can''t really tell Robert''s attitude because of that reflection, but Penny looks pretty optimistic.', '2011-10-01 19:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6557411, 975862, 65234, '<td valign="top">I bet your cat enjoyed this shoot LOL!  You look very serious, Wendy (I don''t think you were enjoying being in front of the camera); the teapot says you are not serious all the time.</td>', 'I bet your cat enjoyed this shoot LOL!  You look very serious, Wendy (I don''t think you were enjoying being in front of the camera); the teapot says you are not serious all the time.', '2011-10-01 19:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6557415, 975875, 65234, '<td valign="top">Hi, Janine and Buddy!  ::waves::  Wonder what caught your attention over there off-camera?  Like the closeness I see here; you are definitely a dog person :-)</td>', 'Hi, Janine and Buddy!  ::waves::  Wonder what caught your attention over there off-camera?  Like the closeness I see here; you are definitely a dog person :-)', '2011-10-01 19:20:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6557418, 974880, 65234, '<td valign="top">This one doesn''t really work for me in this challenge.  Too much of an action shot, no head, and too small for me to tell if there''s another person/animal/reflection.  Sorry.</td>', 'This one doesn''t really work for me in this challenge.  Too much of an action shot, no head, and too small for me to tell if there''s another person/animal/reflection.  Sorry.', '2011-10-01 19:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6557420, 975850, 65234, '<td valign="top">You''re ghosts!  In a pretty purple place.</td>', 'You''re ghosts!  In a pretty purple place.', '2011-10-01 19:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6557422, 975976, 65234, '<td valign="top">He looks like he''s had lots of experience as your paddling partner.</td>', 'He looks like he''s had lots of experience as your paddling partner.', '2011-10-01 19:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6557423, 975754, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nicely done!</td>', 'Nicely done!', '2011-10-01 19:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6557425, 975834, 65234, '<td valign="top">Oh, that''s so cute!  Love that big ol'' slurp you''re getting :-)</td>', 'Oh, that''s so cute!  Love that big ol'' slurp you''re getting :-)', '2011-10-01 19:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6557428, 975977, 65234, '<td valign="top">In a dressing gown, no less.  Classic!</td>', 'In a dressing gown, no less.  Classic!', '2011-10-01 19:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6557429, 975856, 65234, '<td valign="top">Mirrors everywhere!</td>', 'Mirrors everywhere!', '2011-10-01 19:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6557431, 975420, 65234, '<td valign="top">Not exactly a portrait of both subjects but such a cool image.  Lots of stories could be told here.</td>', 'Not exactly a portrait of both subjects but such a cool image.  Lots of stories could be told here.', '2011-10-01 19:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6557432, 975962, 65234, '<td valign="top">The one on the left.  No, the other left.</td>', 'The one on the left.  No, the other left.', '2011-10-01 19:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6557435, 974790, 65234, '<td valign="top">Yay for the rabbit!!  I tried to get a shot of myself with one of mine and couldn''t get anything I liked.  I do have to say, Oliver looks a tad alarmed with his little eyes bulging like that.  But I''m sure you gave him a treat afterwards and he felt much better.</td>', 'Yay for the rabbit!!  I tried to get a shot of myself with one of mine and couldn''t get anything I liked.  I do have to say, Oliver looks a tad alarmed with his little eyes bulging like that.  But I''m sure you gave him a treat afterwards and he felt much better.', '2011-10-01 19:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6557437, 975452, 65234, '<td valign="top">A bit title-dependent but ... I laughed anyway.  Well lit.</td>', 'A bit title-dependent but ... I laughed anyway.  Well lit.', '2011-10-01 19:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6557438, 975747, 65234, '<td valign="top">That''s a wild image!</td>', 'That''s a wild image!', '2011-10-01 19:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
