(6557651, 974880, 130627, '<td valign="top">nice trick - like the flip</td>', 'nice trick - like the flip', '2011-10-01 22:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6557784, 975834, 16106, '<td valign="top">great shot, the moment is well captured, and the framing really puts the emphasis on the action. Lots of good textures everywhere<br/>ought to ribbon</td>', 'great shot, the moment is well captured, and the framing really puts the emphasis on the action. Lots of good textures everywhereought to ribbon', '2011-10-02 00:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6557787, 975096, 16106, '<td valign="top">The only possible knock is the lack of a back light to keep the young man''s head from falling into darkness. Everything else is top notch from the expressions and placement in the frame, to the slight emphasis on the lad bu careful (or lucky) use of light falloff. Great work, ought to ribbon.</td>', 'The only possible knock is the lack of a back light to keep the young man''s head from falling into darkness. Everything else is top notch from the expressions and placement in the frame, to the slight emphasis on the lad bu careful (or lucky) use of light falloff. Great work, ought to ribbon.', '2011-10-02 00:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6557789, 975307, 16106, '<td valign="top">very nice cinematic image, with just a few quibbles. I feel like the main subject is a bit squeezed in the frame, with a bit too much light up in the trees in the upper right. very nice concept and balance. Top ten</td>', 'very nice cinematic image, with just a few quibbles. I feel like the main subject is a bit squeezed in the frame, with a bit too much light up in the trees in the upper right. very nice concept and balance. Top ten', '2011-10-02 00:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6557790, 975674, 42495, '<td valign="top">I''m not voting in this challenge Robert, but if I were you''d receive a high score from me.  Not because I know it''s you, but because of the emotion portrayed here.  I wish you a speedy recovery.</td>', 'I''m not voting in this challenge Robert, but if I were you''d receive a high score from me.  Not because I know it''s you, but because of the emotion portrayed here.  I wish you a speedy recovery.', '2011-10-02 01:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6557791, 975948, 16106, '<td valign="top">Very strong concept and the light on the woman is perfect, but the washed out skin tones on the man''s back draw the eye too strongly and may keep this out of the ribbons where it would have been without this single flaw.</td>', 'Very strong concept and the light on the woman is perfect, but the washed out skin tones on the man''s back draw the eye too strongly and may keep this out of the ribbons where it would have been without this single flaw.', '2011-10-02 01:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6557798, 975677, 16106, '<td valign="top">Great sense of place and the low camera angle really works. I wish there was a bit more sharpness, but you might have been going for that muzzy just woken feel. Strong image as is, personally I would have liked a bit more texture.</td>', 'Great sense of place and the low camera angle really works. I wish there was a bit more sharpness, but you might have been going for that muzzy just woken feel. Strong image as is, personally I would have liked a bit more texture.', '2011-10-02 01:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6557799, 975976, 16106, '<td valign="top">Great use of fill flash, and vivid colors, technically flawless. I wonder if you had any where both you and the dog were looking in the same direction to give it a more unified sense of purpose. Top ten</td>', 'Great use of fill flash, and vivid colors, technically flawless. I wonder if you had any where both you and the dog were looking in the same direction to give it a more unified sense of purpose. Top ten', '2011-10-02 01:06:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6557802, 975897, 16106, '<td valign="top">Nice sense of dislocation, and the partial DeSat works well.</td>', 'Nice sense of dislocation, and the partial DeSat works well.', '2011-10-02 01:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6557804, 975921, 16106, '<td valign="top">Great take on the challenge, I love those fractured reflections. as a pure study of light the upper frame with the power lines and the flare is beautiful, but it makes the +1 too marginal. A tighter frame would have been a better entry, even though it would probably not have been as good a photograph.</td>', 'Great take on the challenge, I love those fractured reflections. as a pure study of light the upper frame with the power lines and the flare is beautiful, but it makes the +1 too marginal. A tighter frame would have been a better entry, even though it would probably not have been as good a photograph.', '2011-10-02 01:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6557810, 975639, 16106, '<td valign="top">Yet another great image that is not as good an entry to this challenge as it might have been. The two figure are only that, figures. The lack of detail only tells us where they are, but very little about who they are. That more personal level of information is pretty important in this challenge. Outside of this challenge that defect probably makes for a stronger image, because the sense of place here is amazing, and by not being specific about the individuals in the frame we can imagine ourselves there. Great framing and handling of very tricky light.</td>', 'Yet another great image that is not as good an entry to this challenge as it might have been. The two figure are only that, figures. The lack of detail only tells us where they are, but very little about who they are. That more personal level of information is pretty important in this challenge. Outside of this challenge that defect probably makes for a stronger image, because the sense of place here is amazing, and by not being specific about the individuals in the frame we can imagine ourselves there. Great framing and handling of very tricky light.', '2011-10-02 01:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6557982, 975747, 103032, '<td valign="top">Stands out in the crowd. Guess this is a reflection. Guess you over sharpened a bit to get the reflected side sharper.  With that said, I think the sharpening works in showing the details of the face.  Also the lighting works in showing the shape of the face.  Hope this does well for you.</td>', 'Stands out in the crowd. Guess this is a reflection. Guess you over sharpened a bit to get the reflected side sharper.  With that said, I think the sharpening works in showing the details of the face.  Also the lighting works in showing the shape of the face.  Hope this does well for you.', '2011-10-02 03:08:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6557989, 975096, 25355, '<td valign="top">Serious portrait, but what might have been fun would have been to paint a beard on Aiden''s face with a burnt cork... ;-Þ</td>', 'Serious portrait, but what might have been fun would have been to paint a beard on Aiden''s face with a burnt cork... ;-Þ', '2011-10-02 03:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6557992, 975936, 100393, '<td valign="top">Blue for me, amongst a challenge full of standout images.<br/> <br/>Brilliant.</td>', 'Blue for me, amongst a challenge full of standout images. Brilliant.', '2011-10-02 04:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6557994, 975876, 100393, '<td valign="top">Out the box brilliant. A 10 (voted earlier) and a fave; I''d already proclaimed my blue to another. They may have to share.</td>', 'Out the box brilliant. A 10 (voted earlier) and a fave; I''d already proclaimed my blue to another. They may have to share.', '2011-10-02 04:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6557995, 975754, 103032, '<td valign="top">First of all, this is a cool self portrait.  Your face is nicely centered in the rearview mirror. Like the idea of driving and taking a SP.  Lots of cool details like the GPS on the dash with a map on it, iPhone with DP Challenge on the screen.<br/> <br/>With that said, I think I just spent the better part of an hour trying to figure out who this is.  I do think this is Brent_S.<br/>Went with the iPhone, looked like your profile pic, map on the gps (iPad?) is Seattle. Hope this does well for you.</td>', 'First of all, this is a cool self portrait.  Your face is nicely centered in the rearview mirror. Like the idea of driving and taking a SP.  Lots of cool details like the GPS on the dash with a map on it, iPhone with DP Challenge on the screen. With that said, I think I just spent the better part of an hour trying to figure out who this is.  I do think this is Brent_S.Went with the iPhone, looked like your profile pic, map on the gps (iPad?) is Seattle. Hope this does well for you.', '2011-10-02 04:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6557996, 975096, 103032, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting. I''d like to see a version with the top of your head not cropped as much, a version with your entire head in the frame. Other than that, nice portrait.</td>', 'I like the lighting. I''d like to see a version with the top of your head not cropped as much, a version with your entire head in the frame. Other than that, nice portrait.', '2011-10-02 04:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6558257, 975714, 101702, '<td valign="top">It seems as though the point of sharpest focus is on the end of the long rather than on the faces which is a shame as the lighting is really nice in tricky conditions.</td>', 'It seems as though the point of sharpest focus is on the end of the long rather than on the faces which is a shame as the lighting is really nice in tricky conditions.', '2011-10-02 17:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6558274, 975876, 101702, '<td valign="top">I feel this is somewhat lacking in the "self portrait" part of the challenge, being only half a hand.</td>', 'I feel this is somewhat lacking in the "self portrait" part of the challenge, being only half a hand.', '2011-10-02 17:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6558275, 974791, 101702, '<td valign="top">Just wondering where the +1 is?</td>', 'Just wondering where the +1 is?', '2011-10-02 17:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6558276, 975981, 101702, '<td valign="top">Which one is you? Also... this is sort of +2 but seeing as the guy at the back is almost not there I guess I could count it as a +1.</td>', 'Which one is you? Also... this is sort of +2 but seeing as the guy at the back is almost not there I guess I could count it as a +1.', '2011-10-02 17:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6558277, 975647, 101702, '<td valign="top">I can see the +1 but think this is lacking a person...</td>', 'I can see the +1 but think this is lacking a person...', '2011-10-02 17:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6558369, 975225, 59695, '<td valign="top">Super idea, and original. - I persoanlly would liked to have seen a little bit more light in on your face, perhaps a relector may have helped, however the lighting on your dog is lovely and captured the textures of his (I assume) fur very well</td>', 'Super idea, and original. - I persoanlly would liked to have seen a little bit more light in on your face, perhaps a relector may have helped, however the lighting on your dog is lovely and captured the textures of his (I assume) fur very well', '2011-10-02 19:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6558370, 975871, 59695, '<td valign="top">A sweet tender fun moment. The image focus seems a little soft, perhaps the intended effect?, I was torn between the muted tones or if a bit more contrast for exagerate the makeup colours, but looking at the image longer the subtle tones work well to provide a more magical feel, again intended?</td>', 'A sweet tender fun moment. The image focus seems a little soft, perhaps the intended effect?, I was torn between the muted tones or if a bit more contrast for exagerate the makeup colours, but looking at the image longer the subtle tones work well to provide a more magical feel, again intended?', '2011-10-02 19:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6558371, 975754, 59695, '<td valign="top">Super shot and idea, I would be interested to know if this is two shots brought together?</td>', 'Super shot and idea, I would be interested to know if this is two shots brought together?', '2011-10-02 19:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6558388, 975868, 124190, '<td valign="top">compelling</td>', 'compelling', '2011-10-02 19:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
