(6559166, 975926, 124190, '<td valign="top">I think you are darker than your dog....after all....why WOULD you strangle it....hold it post-mortem and smell it''s head....     ahhhh....welll.....why NOT???????    sick pup...you  hahahaha  10<br/> <br/>wait maybe you are eating it   I don''t know why but this shot makes me LAUGH....like.......every time I look at it......maybe I am sick</td>', 'I think you are darker than your dog....after all....why WOULD you strangle it....hold it post-mortem and smell it''s head....     ahhhh....welll.....why NOT???????    sick pup...you  hahahaha  10 wait maybe you are eating it   I don''t know why but this shot makes me LAUGH....like.......every time I look at it......maybe I am sick', '2011-10-03 10:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6559167, 975876, 124190, '<td valign="top">I SOOOOOOOOOOOOO want to see this upsidedown.....</td>', 'I SOOOOOOOOOOOOO want to see this upsidedown.....', '2011-10-03 10:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6559270, 975703, 10785, '<td valign="top">This self portrait is captured with great dramatic effect due to the perspective being slightly from below and the tight crop. I get the feel of old Hollywood a la Liz Taylor, even though it is in color. It must be the sharp green eyes, beautifully detailed hair and the high contrast PP. Very nice job with the exposure, keeping the lighting on the forehead from being too harsh and blown out.</td>', 'This self portrait is captured with great dramatic effect due to the perspective being slightly from below and the tight crop. I get the feel of old Hollywood a la Liz Taylor, even though it is in color. It must be the sharp green eyes, beautifully detailed hair and the high contrast PP. Very nice job with the exposure, keeping the lighting on the forehead from being too harsh and blown out.', '2011-10-03 12:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6559273, 975905, 73564, '<td valign="top">Great shot!! (no vote yet)</td>', 'Great shot!! (no vote yet)', '2011-10-03 12:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
