(6559655, 974841, 10785, '<td valign="top">I find this somewhat humorous even if unintentionally! Pardon me if it is not the case, and I mean no offense, but this to me shows a guy with an ego trying to be the star of the show, blurring out and overshadowing his less egotistical friend... Like I said, I find it humorous and don''t mean it personally.</td>', 'I find this somewhat humorous even if unintentionally! Pardon me if it is not the case, and I mean no offense, but this to me shows a guy with an ego trying to be the star of the show, blurring out and overshadowing his less egotistical friend... Like I said, I find it humorous and don''t mean it personally.', '2011-10-03 21:12:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6559658, 975625, 10785, '<td valign="top">Again another great social commentary on male/female roles. I love what this photo says about the state of man/woman relationships. It is sad but the truth speaks loudly.</td>', 'Again another great social commentary on male/female roles. I love what this photo says about the state of man/woman relationships. It is sad but the truth speaks loudly.', '2011-10-03 21:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
