(6560005, 975869, 10785, '<td valign="top">I will offer a comment as a low voter on this image. I see the fun in creating the image, but I don''t see the merit. This looks like a selective desaturation of some sort using a range of brown color as the saturated color?? It seems kind of odd. Then there is the blown highlights or erasing of data in a range of tones... I don''t see why? The other thing that brings this one down for me is the poor choice of cluttered background. I kind of get the title which goes along with the missing data in the image which is a positive part of the image, but on the whole, not real good. Fun, but not real good.</td>', 'I will offer a comment as a low voter on this image. I see the fun in creating the image, but I don''t see the merit. This looks like a selective desaturation of some sort using a range of brown color as the saturated color?? It seems kind of odd. Then there is the blown highlights or erasing of data in a range of tones... I don''t see why? The other thing that brings this one down for me is the poor choice of cluttered background. I kind of get the title which goes along with the missing data in the image which is a positive part of the image, but on the whole, not real good. Fun, but not real good.', '2011-10-04 09:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6560008, 974964, 124815, '<td valign="top">Eye to eye.<br/>Voted earlier</td>', 'Eye to eye.Voted earlier', '2011-10-04 09:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6560010, 975905, 10785, '<td valign="top">I think this is a good clean shot. No real color issues and a good exposure given the light used. You kept the harsh shadows out of the face which is hard to do. I think the composition is a little odd for a portrait. I would like a more centered subject with a little less space on the head. There has to be a story behind this which wasn''t really portrayed. But I am sure it is funny to those who know!</td>', 'I think this is a good clean shot. No real color issues and a good exposure given the light used. You kept the harsh shadows out of the face which is hard to do. I think the composition is a little odd for a portrait. I would like a more centered subject with a little less space on the head. There has to be a story behind this which wasn''t really portrayed. But I am sure it is funny to those who know!', '2011-10-04 09:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6560012, 975978, 10785, '<td valign="top">I get the fit to the challenge. I think the image is a little more graphic design than photograph. The use of a negative with the single tone is interesting but there are noise issues all over the background which kind of spoils the graphic look. And with this crop, a centered subject would look much better. I think it would make an interesting sticker!</td>', 'I get the fit to the challenge. I think the image is a little more graphic design than photograph. The use of a negative with the single tone is interesting but there are noise issues all over the background which kind of spoils the graphic look. And with this crop, a centered subject would look much better. I think it would make an interesting sticker!', '2011-10-04 09:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6560014, 975862, 124815, '<td valign="top">Last time I "saw" you it was pouring milk in the precious Canon lenses. Hmm, the milk connection .... The squirels ... The awards ... Milk ...i got confused ...<br/>And voted earlier</td>', 'Last time I "saw" you it was pouring milk in the precious Canon lenses. Hmm, the milk connection .... The squirels ... The awards ... Milk ...i got confused ...And voted earlier', '2011-10-04 10:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6560015, 975647, 10785, '<td valign="top">This is a little too basic for me to be a real high scoring image. The use of reflection is ok, but the point of the challenge was to shoot yourself and a reflection, not just the reflection. Overall, the color has a blue cast probably due to a wrong white balance setting or the reflected light from the truck.</td>', 'This is a little too basic for me to be a real high scoring image. The use of reflection is ok, but the point of the challenge was to shoot yourself and a reflection, not just the reflection. Overall, the color has a blue cast probably due to a wrong white balance setting or the reflected light from the truck.', '2011-10-04 10:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6560016, 975962, 124815, '<td valign="top">Now how many times can I look at these pics - and I mean BOTH of them?!<br/>I am fascinated by the subject!<br/>Still unable to give a mark. This is the cool one, in the moonlight.</td>', 'Now how many times can I look at these pics - and I mean BOTH of them?!I am fascinated by the subject!Still unable to give a mark. This is the cool one, in the moonlight.', '2011-10-04 10:01:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6560017, 975942, 124815, '<td valign="top">Now how many times can I look at these pics - and I mean BOTH of them?!<br/>I am fascinated by the subject!<br/>Still unable to give a mark. And by the warmth of the fire.</td>', 'Now how many times can I look at these pics - and I mean BOTH of them?!I am fascinated by the subject!Still unable to give a mark. And by the warmth of the fire.', '2011-10-04 10:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6560018, 975913, 124815, '<td valign="top">Precious!</td>', 'Precious!', '2011-10-04 10:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6560019, 974621, 10785, '<td valign="top">There''s the fat bastard making his rounds. The subject and the use of this prop is getting old real quick. It''s not really catching on for me as a statement of pop culture or artistic merit. I think you should shelf the project and move on to something better and more profitable.</td>', 'There''s the fat bastard making his rounds. The subject and the use of this prop is getting old real quick. It''s not really catching on for me as a statement of pop culture or artistic merit. I think you should shelf the project and move on to something better and more profitable.', '2011-10-04 10:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6560020, 974880, 10785, '<td valign="top">A definite no-no is to enter a tiny photo. I am sure this has been commented on already. But use the maximum amount of pixels allowed for a better result. Also the challenge was to shoot yourself with someone else or with a reflection. This shot fails to show that and does not meet the challenge. Nice effort though!</td>', 'A definite no-no is to enter a tiny photo. I am sure this has been commented on already. But use the maximum amount of pixels allowed for a better result. Also the challenge was to shoot yourself with someone else or with a reflection. This shot fails to show that and does not meet the challenge. Nice effort though!', '2011-10-04 10:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6560022, 975965, 10785, '<td valign="top">I think the point of the challenge was to shoot yourself along with the reflection. Everybody pretty much got that idea so it must have been pretty clear. This shot doesn''t really meet the challenge description..  The merits of the shot are few... good color but a little dark on the exposure. You are mostly in shadow and overall it is dark. It looks like you exposed for the light in the background over by your "bed" or whatever that thing is next to the computer desk.</td>', 'I think the point of the challenge was to shoot yourself along with the reflection. Everybody pretty much got that idea so it must have been pretty clear. This shot doesn''t really meet the challenge description..  The merits of the shot are few... good color but a little dark on the exposure. You are mostly in shadow and overall it is dark. It looks like you exposed for the light in the background over by your "bed" or whatever that thing is next to the computer desk.', '2011-10-04 10:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6560025, 975973, 10785, '<td valign="top">Good emotion captured here. Family pride is shown well. It is good to honor your father. I like the sepia as it adds to the emotion of the shot and captures that vintage family photo feel. However the photo is lacking in tonal range appearing mostly to be middle grey. Great subject for this challenge!</td>', 'Good emotion captured here. Family pride is shown well. It is good to honor your father. I like the sepia as it adds to the emotion of the shot and captures that vintage family photo feel. However the photo is lacking in tonal range appearing mostly to be middle grey. Great subject for this challenge!', '2011-10-04 10:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6560026, 975980, 10785, '<td valign="top">Very bright colors adds interest. Overall I think there is too much shown to the left side of the photo. I would have liked to see the model and the house central to the shot. The side yard doesn''t add much content. It looks like a white vignette was added, which is ok but it is a little pronounced.</td>', 'Very bright colors adds interest. Overall I think there is too much shown to the left side of the photo. I would have liked to see the model and the house central to the shot. The side yard doesn''t add much content. It looks like a white vignette was added, which is ok but it is a little pronounced.', '2011-10-04 10:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6560029, 975270, 10785, '<td valign="top">A little off focus. Hard contrast is ok but adds that harsh highlighted area on the face. A nice evenly lit face is preferred. Good pose and fun shot!</td>', 'A little off focus. Hard contrast is ok but adds that harsh highlighted area on the face. A nice evenly lit face is preferred. Good pose and fun shot!', '2011-10-04 10:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6560033, 975856, 10785, '<td valign="top">Interesting angles on the mirror to capture yourself + yourself a few more times. I think you used a reverse "S" curves adjustment on this and it brought down the contrast and brightness of the shot decreasing the light on the face and making the shot kind of pale and dark overall. That is my guess anyway...</td>', 'Interesting angles on the mirror to capture yourself + yourself a few more times. I think you used a reverse "S" curves adjustment on this and it brought down the contrast and brightness of the shot decreasing the light on the face and making the shot kind of pale and dark overall. That is my guess anyway...', '2011-10-04 10:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
