(6561093, 975920, 69388, '<td valign="top">Thank you so much for a warm welcome after a long, long break, the more that the picture was accidental and an outtake of a series I''ve been working on recently.<br/>Yes, Charlie does look like he is going to end up in a stew (that made me laugh so hard) -scared and anxious , and my pose is leaving a lot to wish for but it was not planned like that - he just wouldn''t budge from that spot ;)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-10-05 09:23:10.</i></td>', 'Thank you so much for a warm welcome after a long, long break, the more that the picture was accidental and an outtake of a series I''ve been working on recently.Yes, Charlie does look like he is going to end up in a stew (that made me laugh so hard) -scared and anxious , and my pose is leaving a lot to wish for but it was not planned like that - he just wouldn''t budge from that spot ;)', '2011-10-05 08:51:38.000000', '2011-10-05 10:23:10.000000', 0),
