(6561372, 975942, 77196, '<td valign="top">Isn''t it interesting that these two photos got different scores? Again, a very nice shot - great expressions. Nice lighting on this. <br/>Don''t know, but if you wanted to push to similarities, you might have gone B&amp;W with similar toned dresses. <br/>It is a common thing to compare ourselves with others. Although I''m not a twin, I would think it would be even harder for them. In reality, there is no need to compare. You each are an attractive lady, with her own unique perspectives and perceptions. Your face shows your love of life. No comparison is needed, but having two individuals who share those similar qualities together in one picture just makes them so much brighter and stronger.</td>', 'Isn''t it interesting that these two photos got different scores? Again, a very nice shot - great expressions. Nice lighting on this. Don''t know, but if you wanted to push to similarities, you might have gone B&W with similar toned dresses. It is a common thing to compare ourselves with others. Although I''m not a twin, I would think it would be even harder for them. In reality, there is no need to compare. You each are an attractive lady, with her own unique perspectives and perceptions. Your face shows your love of life. No comparison is needed, but having two individuals who share those similar qualities together in one picture just makes them so much brighter and stronger.', '2011-10-05 12:34:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(6561373, 975454, 77196, '<td valign="top">I don''t know about the outtake. That mask makes him look really scary!<br/></td>', 'I don''t know about the outtake. That mask makes him look really scary!', '2011-10-05 12:35:47.000000', NULL, 0),
