(6651312, 975944, 27812, '<td valign="top">Touching image, emotional. See this as a ''Get Well Soon / Missing You'' card. Personally, a proper sepia or lith-process would have appealed much more than the lighter yellowish that looks a tad washed out. Increased contrast perhaps? A slight burn of the path may also help, unfortunately my eyes are drawn to the path more than it should be; a typical problem with white in the negative space.</td>', 'Touching image, emotional. See this as a ''Get Well Soon / Missing You'' card. Personally, a proper sepia or lith-process would have appealed much more than the lighter yellowish that looks a tad washed out. Increased contrast perhaps? A slight burn of the path may also help, unfortunately my eyes are drawn to the path more than it should be; a typical problem with white in the negative space.', '2012-01-21 11:56:55.000000', NULL, 0),
